|cffffff00-zoom XXXX|r » set camera height to entered value [1400 -> 3000]
|cffffff00-players|r » show player names (with Battletag)
|cffffff00-swap|r » SD / AR only and during the countdown timer
|cffffff00-repick|r » only for AR and during the countdown timer
|cffffff00-pool XX|r » activate / deactivate autopool to player
|cffffff00-kd|r » show your KD
|cffffff00-time|r » show current game time
|cffffff00-killme / -forfeit|r » kill your base
|cffffff00-votekick|r » vote to kick an ally
}

